"ppub"><day>26</day><month>1</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><volume>184</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>335</fpage><lpage>335</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2009 by the Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2009</copyright-year></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 183 No. 7, December 29, 2008. Pages <related-article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="183" page="1243" id="d31e93" xlink:href="19114593" ext-link-type="pubmed">1243&#x02013;1257</related-article>.</p><p>Due to a production error, labels were cut from the x axis of <xref ref-type="fig" rid="fig1">Fig. 5 E</xref>. The correct image appears below.</p><fig id="fig1" fig-type="figure" position="anchor"><caption><p>Effects of Myc and p19<sup>ARF</sup> on CNTF-dependent STAT3 phosphorylation at Y705 (pSTAT3). *, P &#x0003c; 0.01 compared with mock-treated culture; <sup>$</sup>, P &#x0003c; 0.01 compared with control virus&#x02013;infected culture. Error bars indicate mean + SD.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="JCB_200807130_RGB_Fig5Ecorrection"/></fig></body></article>